{% comment %}
  Custom Multi-Tiered Luxury Footer
  Handcrafted Rugs & Executive Office Furniture:
  - Tier 1: Top Trust Badges Bar (Shipping, Concierge, 100% Authentic, 9,000 Reviews)
  - Tier 2: Main Body with Store Brand (The Golden Rug), Trustpilot Widget & 5 Link Columns
  - Tier 3: Contact Phone Support & Colorful Social Media Circles
  - Tier 4: Bottom Copyright & Payment Pills Bar + Back to Top Button
{% endcomment %}

